  "description": "Ki-sam, a father, wants his children to get married, have children, and start a normal family. However, the family is on the verge of division due to the five siblings who choose abnormal lives for various reasons. The conflict deepens with the youngest child's bombshell announcement about to get married and the appearance of the oldest child leaving home. Will they be able to reconcile with each other and restore true family values?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=826417), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11157749)",
